<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Repair Pulse</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Repair Pulse</ansi> is the mending beam of a <ansi fg="command">Repair Frame</ansi> — the spindly
construct add that the Crash Site bosses wake from wall alcoves when
wounded. Each pulse knits the boss's cracked plating back together,
stalling the party's progress.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  Kill the Repair Frame. It is fragile — a "job to manage," not a
  damage sponge — so peel off and destroy it before it heals the boss
  back to full. Ignore it and the fight will not end.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help core-discharge</ansi>
